   "heading": "WEIGHTED DEPENDENCY GRAPHS AND THE ISING MODEL 1. Introduction and statement of results 1.1. Cumulants in the Ising model. The Ising model is a mathematical model of ferro-magnetism in statistical physics. It was introduced in 1920 by Wilhelm Lenz who gave it as a problem to his Ph.D. student Ernst",
